# --- ڳانڊڙا — groups written in the middle or at the end of a word ---
# Book pages 15 (dots 5-6) and 17 (dots 4-6).  Both tables are printed almost
# entirely BLANK: only three rows on each page carry an entry.  These six are
# everything the book gives.  `midendword` is the exact match for the heading
# «لفظن جا وچان ۽ پويان ڳانڊڙا» — medial and final groups.
